<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Echlin cut to hold.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Echlin cut to hold.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Salomon Brothers Inc said it downgraded Echlin Inc to hold from buy.</p>
<p>-- said cut its second quarter earnings forecast to $0.38 a share from $0.48 a share.</p>
<p>-- cited the company's announcement that it see flat second quarter earnings and sales.</p>
<p>-- Echlin gained 1/8 to 30-7/8.</p>
<p>(( -- Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
